  {
    "__type__": "cc.RichText",
    "_name": "",
    "_objFlags": 0,
    "node": {
      "__id__": 64
    },
    "_enabled": true,
    "_fontFamily": "Arial",
    "_isSystemFontUsed": true,
    "_N$string": "<color=#cccccc><size=23><b>\n        1.Invite your friends to download the game: <a href=\"${url}\"><u><color=#00ffffff>${url}</color></u></a>, Ask your friend to tell you his game ID.\n        2.Click the Invite function in the Club and enter his game ID, so that he will join your Club.\n        3.Your friend transfers money to you, you recharge his coins, and when he needs to withdraw money,you deduct his wallet coins and then transfer the money to your friend. All the income he generates belongs to you.\n        4.You can also give your subordinate the authority to control his subordinates in Management, so that he will become your subordinate agent\n        5.If you don't have enough available coins, please contact customer service to purchase coins.\n        </b></size></color>",
    "_N$horizontalAlign": 0,
    "_N$fontSize": 35,
    "_N$font": null,
    "_N$cacheMode": 0,
    "_N$maxWidth": 1300,
    "_N$lineHeight": 52,
