    "_string": "1. Contact customer service to set up your club.\n2. Invite friends to join your club.\n3. You control the recharge and withdrawal of all club membersand \nyou get all the profits generated by your club members.\n4. Each of your club members will bring you about < $5000-20000 \nofincome per month. The more members you invite, the more you will earn. \n5. Each newly established club will be given $5000 directly.",
